{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:758e5466b2e07d2b","name":"Mankvim-814 Light Interceptor","source":{"id":"source:reference-758e5466b2e07d2b","title":"Mankvim-814 Light Interceptor","revision":18745,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T20:39:27Z","sha256":"64c62b03d6ba77b735c689f1a32d54c19715bb66858766ad3e7fe367f16727f3","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18745","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Mankvim-814%20Light%20Interceptor&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-758e5466b2e07d2b","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Confederacy of Independent Systems"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Confederacy_of_Independent_Systems","referenceId":"reference:dfc46c9d666b9b41"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Corporate Sector Authority"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Corporate_Sector_Authority","referenceId":"reference:3e2d5cb8bf4c298d"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Another cheap and expendable fighter used by the Confederacy during ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Clone Wars"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Clone_Wars"},", the Mankvim-814 Light Interceptor (often referred to as the Techno Union Fighter) was a speedy but fragile Starship constructed on the planet ",{"tag":"a","children":["Utapau"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Utapau","referenceId":"reference:236cdadb0b901b45"},". Though flown mostly by ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," pilots, the Mankvim-814 boasted an actual cockpit and controls, so that a living ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Pilot","referenceId":"reference:4aff6d0e54fff36e"}," could take the controls of the ship (unlike the Droid Starfighters, which featured no cockpit whatsoever). Bulbous and sleek, the Mankvim-814 was a fast ship that relied upon its speed for defense rather than the strength of its hull or shields.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["During the latter days of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Clone Wars"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Clone_Wars"},", the Techno Union needed ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighters"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighters","referenceId":"reference:e127af2636e147fc"}," desperately for its war efforts, and the Mankvim-814 is the result of this need. When ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Clone Wars"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Clone_Wars"}," ended and the Empire rose, the Mankvim-814 was relegated to the ranks of mostly forgotten ships from the time before the Empire. However, the Mankvim-814 continues to be used heavily in ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Corporate Sector"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Corporate_Sector?action=edit&redlink=1"},", where many of the remnants of the Techno Union reside. Though originally built on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Utapau"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Utapau","referenceId":"reference:236cdadb0b901b45"},", the Mankvim-814 continues to see limited production runs in ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Corporate Sector"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Corporate_Sector?action=edit&redlink=1"},", and some members of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Corporate Sector Authority"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Corporate_Sector_Authority","referenceId":"reference:3e2d5cb8bf4c298d"}," utilize the Starfighters to augment their already expansive fighter corps.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Capabilities"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["The Mankvim-814 is a speedy ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighter"}," that can blast its way across the battlefield in a matter of moments. Among the fastest of all ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighters"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighters","referenceId":"reference:e127af2636e147fc"},", the Mankvim-814 isn't as maneuverable as some ships in the days of the Galactic Civil War and tends to be used only by civilians looking for a quick ship, regardless of defenses or armament. Though the Techno Union cared little for the ship's defenses (after all, most pilots were expendable ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"},"), the ship does have minimal shielding to give it some durability. However, if a shot penetrates the vessel's shields, the chances of its survival are slim.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Hastily put together (and likely engineered just as rapidly), the Mankvim-814 Light Interceptor is not the most survivable ship ever produced, though it is fast enough that many of the models left over from ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Clone Wars"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Clone_Wars"}," were converted into one-person courier vessels. Since the ships do not have a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hyperdrive"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hyperdrive","referenceId":"reference:6774bf610b6e6f09"},", they are effective only within a star system, and most are used to ferry small cargoes or sensitive messages between nearby planets and moons.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Default (Normal)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Mankvim-814 Light Interceptor Statistics (CL 5)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Gargantuan ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighter"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +3; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.mirahez